D M 13~
zilanthor mist dragon~
Zilanthor~
The great mist dragon Zilanthor coalesces before you.
~
The powerfull form of the great mist dragon is almost serpentine, lacking
the wings common to most dragons. While he lacks wings, Zilanthor does
possess four legs equipped with deadly ripping talons that look quite
capable of tearing down a castle wall, you tremble at the thought of what they
may do to you. You also note with some trepidation, that Zilanthor's great
head houses a pair of jaws from which misty vapors constantly trail outwards.
As you look upwards, you can't help but flinch as you see two great draconian
eyes as large as your head, that have been studying you all along.
~
